# Checks before push

Before any `git push`, run both checks:

1. `npm --prefix config run format:check`
2. `npm --prefix config run build` (Jekyll via `src/Gemfile`)

If Prettier fails:

1. Run `npm --prefix config run format`
2. Commit the formatting changes
3. Re-run `npm --prefix config run format:check`

If Jekyll fails:

1. Run `npm --prefix config run build` and fix the errors
2. Commit the fix
3. Re-run `npm --prefix config run build`

Only then push. Do not skip this for "push everything" or similar. GitHub runs the same checks on `main` (`prettier.yml` and `jekyll.yml`).
